-
-Dubbo allows you to build RPC services using a minimal codebase and a lightweight SDK. It supports protocols like:
-
-- [Triple (gRPC-compatible)](https://dubbo.apache.org/zh-cn/overview/reference/protocols/triple/)
-- Dubbo2 (TCP)
-- REST
-- Custom protocols
